{1}{[This dark, brooding figure slowly turns to face you. His brutish features somehow accentuate his noble stature, rather than detract from it as one would expect.] So. They have finally sent someone to kill me, have they?}{[This dark, brooding figure slowly turns to face you. His brutish features somehow accentuate his noble stature, rather than detract from it as one would expect.] So. They have finally sent someone to kill me, have they?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{I am here to convince you to surrender.}{}{5}{qa1145 1}{15}{ }
{3}{I am here to deliver a message from Mr. Babcock.}{}{5}{qa1146 1}{275}{ }
{4}{I here talk you give up.}{}{-4}{qa1145 1}{165}{ }
{5}{No, I am here to join your cause.}{}{5}{}{225}{ }
{15}{Surrender? Deliver my fate into the hands of those narrow minded oppressors? Not likely. Even were I to survive the experience, which I doubt, it would do nothing to change the plight of my brothers. We must be heard.}{Surrender? Deliver my fate into the hands of those narrow minded oppressors? Not likely. Even were I to survive the experience, which I doubt, it would do nothing to change the plight of my brothers. We must be heard.}{}{}{}{ }
{16}{There are journalists out front, you can speak with them.}{}{5}{}{25}{ }
{17}{Wheeler wouldn't dare kill you in front of the crowd out there.}{}{5}{}{35}{ }
{25}{Of course, what a capital idea! Those muckraking fools will print anything to sell a paper, even the ravings of an insane half orc. After Wheeler massacred the last group of protesters, there was an outcry of support for us, albeit a small one. But any support for us at all was unheard of before that incident.}{Of course, what a capital idea! Those muckraking fools will print anything to sell a paper, even the ravings of an insane half orc. After Wheeler massacred the last group of protesters, there was an outcry of support for us, albeit a small one. But any support for us at all was unheard of before that incident.}{}{}{}{ }
{26}{I am certain the press would rally behind your cause.}{}{5}{}{55}{ }
{27}{You could make Wheeler look the fool in front of the press.}{}{5}{}{65}{ }
{35}{Wheeler! Of course he would. And the papers would congratulate him for removing a threat to society. They love to build up villains and heroes, regardless of what the truth may be.}{Wheeler! Of course he would. And the papers would congratulate him for removing a threat to society. They love to build up villains and heroes, regardless of what the truth may be.}{}{}{}{ }
{36}{No, it was Wheeler's suggestion that you talk to the press.}{}{5}{}{45}{ }
{37}{Make him out the foolish villain to the press, then.}{}{5}{}{65}{ }
{45}{Are you really that naive? This is all a set up to lure me outside, and press or no press, Wheeler is planning on killing me. [He moves toward you, menacingly.] The only question I have is whether you came in here to set me up knowingly.}{Are you really that naive? This is all a set up to lure me outside, and press or no press, Wheeler is planning on killing me. [He moves toward you, menacingly.] The only question I have is whether you came in here to set me up knowingly.}{}{}{}{ }
{46}{I swear I had no idea. I was simply trying to help.}{}{5}{}{95}{ }
{47}{Oh, I came in planning to kill you. I was just toying with you.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 405 ,co}
{55}{They rally behind no cause! They have no point of view, save the one that will sell newspapers that day. They would just as soon report on me being gunned down in the street as they would print what I had to say. As a matter of fact, I believe they would prefer me dead in the street, it's more dramatic.}{They rally behind no cause! They have no point of view, save the one that will sell newspapers that day. They would just as soon report on me being gunned down in the street as they would print what I had to say. As a matter of fact, I believe they would prefer me dead in the street, it's more dramatic.}{}{}{}{ }
{56}{I don't believe it. The people would rather hear the truth.}{}{5}{}{45}{ }
{57}{But what if you could make Wheeler look the fool?}{}{5}{}{65}{ }
{58}{Wheeler dead would be more dramatic. That would grab people.}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{65}{And that would not be a difficult task. He is a buffoon, at best. This idea is beginning to intrigue me, that I will admit.}{And that would not be a difficult task. He is a buffoon, at best. This idea is beginning to intrigue me, that I will admit.}{}{}{}{ }
{66}{The contrast of your views with Wheeler's would sway people.}{}{5}{}{75}{ }
{75}{[A broad smile appears on his face.] I don't know if that's true, people's beliefs are hard to sway. Truth very rarely enters into it. No, what I am interested in is making Wheeler look to be a fool. If I could get people to question his abilities as Capt. of the Guard, they would then begin to question his supporters on the council...}{[A broad smile appears on his face.] I don't know if that's true, people's beliefs are hard to sway. Truth very rarely enters into it. No, what I am interested in is making Wheeler look to be a fool. If I could get people to question his abilities as Capt. of the Guard, they would then begin to question his supporters on the council...}{}{}{}{ }
{76}{Exactly.}{}{5}{}{85}{ }
{85}{I believe you have convinced me, sir. I will do it.}{I believe you have convinced me, madam. I will do it.}{}{}{}{gf2441 1 }
{86}{Let me go tell Wheeler you are coming out peacefully.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{95}{Then be off with you. Tell Wheeler I'm not coming out, he'll have to come in and get me. And he will die in the attempt.}{Then be off with you. Tell Wheeler I'm not coming out, he'll have to come in and get me. And he will die in the attempt.}{}{}{}{gf2442 1, qu1145 6 }
{96}{I've got a better idea, let's kill them all!}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{104}{I see. I will deliver your message. Good day.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{105}{What? Are you insane?}{What? Are you insane?}{}{}{}{ }
{106}{You know they'll kill you if they get the chance.}{}{5}{}{115}{ }
{107}{These bloated fools will never listen to reason. I say they die!}{}{5}{}{145}{ }
{108}{I was simply jesting.}{}{5}{lf2 1}{245}{ }
{115}{You would just have me rush headlong into certain death? What would that accomplish?}{That is not new information.}{}{}{}{ }
{116}{Dying like a caged animal would accomplish even less.}{}{5}{}{125}{ }
{117}{I don't know. But it would be fun.}{}{5}{}{145}{ }
{125}{Do not go gentle into that good night and all that, eh? I suppose it is best to be able to choose the manner of your death than to have it thrust upon you. But what of the innocent lives that will be lost?}{Do not go gentle into that good night and all that, eh? I suppose it is best to be able to choose the manner of your death than to have it thrust upon you. But what of the innocent lives that will be lost?}{}{}{}{ }
{126}{Innocents?! Did they do anything to stop Wheeler?}{}{5}{}{215}{ }
{134}{I suppose you are right. Forget I mentioned it.}{}{5}{}{155}{ }
{135}{[A fierce hatred begins to erupt behind his eyes.] Twenty of my people. Killed. No retribution, no remorse...you are right sir. Tarant dies tonight!}{[A fierce hatred begins to erupt behind his eyes.] Twenty of my people. Killed. No retribution, no remorse...you are right madam. Tarant dies tonight!}{}{}{}{rp1043, gf2627 0, fp }
{136}{We'll make the bastards pay!}{}{5}{}{0}{gf2443 1, fl 450}
{137}{We kill people!}{}{-4}{}{0}{gf2443 1, fl 450}
{145}{You are a raving loon! Please leave, I do not need your kind around here, attempting to start a riot. Goodbye.}{You are a raving loon! Please leave, I do not need your kind around here, attempting to start a riot. Goodbye.}{}{}{}{lf1 1 }
{146}{No one speaks to me that way! Die, fool!}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 405 ,co}
{154}{Goodbye, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{155}{It is forgotten. Please leave me be, I need to plan my next move.}{It is forgotten. Please leave me be, I need to plan my next move.}{}{}{}{ }
{156}{I will be leaving, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf2 1 }
{165}{Why did they send an imbecile in here to talk to me?}{Why did they send an imbecile in here to talk to me?}{}{}{}{ }
{166}{I not bimbaseal. I talk good. You give up now?}{}{-4}{}{175}{ }
{167}{I no like you call me that. I hurt you now.}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 405 ,co}
{175}{Wheeler must think me as big a fool as you if he sent you to convince me to surrender.}{Wheeler must think me as big a fool as you if he sent you to convince me to surrender.}{}{}{}{ }
{176}{Huh? Me convinting you?}{}{-4}{}{185}{ }
{185}{No, you are not. Your friend Wheeler sent you in here to die, you realize that, right?}{No, you are not. Your friend Wheeler sent you in here to die, you realize that, right?}{}{}{}{ }
{186}{I no like heelerb.}{}{-4}{}{195}{ }
{187}{Nuh uh. I kill you first.}{}{-4}{}{0}{fl 405 ,co}
{194}{Okay. I go.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{195}{Neither do I friend, neither do I. I would kill him, if I were to get the chance, as a matter of fact. He killed twenty of my people, mercilessly, not too long ago.}{Neither do I friend, neither do I. I would kill him, if I were to get the chance, as a matter of fact. He killed twenty of my people, mercilessly, not too long ago.}{}{}{}{ }
{196}{We go kill him now?}{}{-4}{}{205}{ }
{197}{I go away.}{}{-4}{}{0}{ }
{205}{I would like nothing better, but there are innocent lives to think of.}{I would like nothing better, but there are innocent lives to think of.}{}{}{}{ }
{206}{Innopence? They help when weebler kill you friends?}{}{-4}{}{215}{ }
{215}{No, no they did not. [He grits his teeth.] They stood by and watched.}{No, no they did not. [He grits his teeth.] They stood by and watched.}{}{}{}{ }
{216}{It is time they felt your pain, I believe.}{}{5}{}{135}{ }
{217}{They send you pretty flower cause they sorry?}{}{-4}{}{135}{ }
{225}{What? I'm meant to believe that you want to throw in with the orcs?}{What? I'm meant to believe that you want to throw in with the orcs?}{}{}{}{ }
{226}{I am half orc, after all.}{}{5}{ra7}{235}{ }
{227}{Your plight speaks to me.}{}{5}{ra-7}{255}{ }
{234}{No, I have made a mistake. I will be leaving.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{235}{I know, but most half orcs try to stay as far away from full orcs as possible. Ashamed of their heritage. It heartens me to see someone who is willing to be looked down upon with the rest of us.}{I know, but most half orcs try to stay as far away from full orcs as possible. Ashamed of their heritage. It heartens me to see someone who is willing to be looked down upon with the rest of us.}{}{}{}{ }
{236}{I'm not here to be looked down on, I'm here to kill our enemies!}{}{5}{}{105}{lf2 1 }
{237}{What is your plan?}{}{5}{}{265}{ }
{245}{What is it you are here for, then?}{What is it you are here for, then?}{}{}{}{ }
{246}{I am here to convince you to surrender.}{}{5}{qa1145 1}{15}{ }
{247}{I am here to deliver a message from Mr. Babcock.}{}{5}{qa1146 1, qb1146 6}{275}{ }
{254}{}{}{}{}{}{ }
{255}{It speaks to you?! What does it say? That we are fighting a hopeless battle? That we will never be treated with respect? No one voluntarily joins with orcs - why are you really here?}{It speaks to you?! What does it say? That we are fighting a hopeless battle? That we will never be treated with respect? No one voluntarily joins with orcs - why are you really here?}{}{}{}{ }
{256}{I am here to convince you to surrender.}{}{5}{qa1145 1}{15}{ }
{257}{I am here to deliver a message from Mr. Babcock.}{}{5}{qa1146 1, qb1146 6}{275}{ }
{264}{I am here to help you burn Tarant to the ground!}{}{5}{}{105}{lf2 1 }
{265}{Sadly, there is not much of one. I had hoped to negotiate quietly with the owner, perhaps build some sort of understanding between us, but he had heard too much of the bile spewed by the hate mongers and ran when he saw me. Unfortunately, Wheeler was nearby, and showed up with his guards, turning this into another "incident".}{Sadly, there is not much of one. I had hoped to negotiate quietly with the owner, perhaps build some sort of understanding between us, but he had heard too much of the bile spewed by the hate mongers and ran when he saw me. Unfortunately, Wheeler was nearby, and showed up with his guards, turning this into another "incident".}{}{}{}{ }
{266}{It seems the time has come for armed revolt.}{}{5}{}{105}{lf2 1 }
{267}{Surrender may be your only option.}{}{5}{qa1145 1}{15}{ }
{268}{Mr. Babcock has an idea he would like you to consider.}{}{5}{qa1146 1, qb1146 6}{275}{ }
{275}{Babcock? What does he want? Does he still think we can gain rights through the system?}{Babcock? What does he want? Does he still think we can gain rights through the system?}{}{}{}{ }
{276}{Yes. He has devised a way for you to gain the right to unionize.}{}{5}{}{285}{ }
{285}{Why should I listen to him? Or you, for that matter?}{Why should I listen to him? Or you, for that matter?}{}{}{}{ }
{286}{You can continue to hide out in factories, I suppose...}{}{5}{}{295}{ }
{287}{He is a good man who only wants to help you.}{}{5}{}{365}{ }
{295}{Touche! Your wit serves you well, and you do make a good point. What is Babcock selling, this time?}{Touche! Your wit serves you well, and you do make a good point. What is Babcock selling, this time?}{}{}{}{ }
{296}{He wants to take your case to court.}{}{5}{lf10 0}{305}{ }
{297}{Something that will put you legally beyond Wheeler's reach.}{}{5}{}{325}{ }
{298}{He wants to take your case to court.}{}{5}{lf10 1}{375}{ }
{305}{I don't think so. The laws are all against us, and when they can be shown not to be, the courts have a way of passing new laws to keep us oppressed.}{I don't think so. The laws are all against us, and when they can be shown not to be, the courts have a way of passing new laws to keep us oppressed.}{}{}{}{ }
{306}{Mr. Babcock is a learned individual. You should trust him.}{}{5}{}{315}{ }
{307}{The court needs to be fooled into ruling in your favor.}{}{5}{}{385}{lf10 1 }
{315}{I have had enough of your drivel. As a matter of fact, I had had enough of it last time I spoke with Babcock. Please leave me be.}{I have had enough of your drivel. As a matter of fact, I had had enough of it last time I spoke with Babcock. Please leave me be.}{}{}{}{qu1146 6 }
{316}{Alright, I'm leaving.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{325}{Hmmm. Alright, you have my ear. It would be intensely gratifying to use the law against Wheeler for once, instead of the other way around.}{Hmmm. Alright, you have my ear. It would be intensely gratifying to use the law against Wheeler for once, instead of the other way around.}{}{}{}{ }
{326}{He wants to establish your rights as someone who is half human.}{}{5}{}{335}{ }
{335}{I see. If it is done skillfully enough, it may work...and then what?}{I see. If it is done skillfully enough, it may work...and then what?}{}{}{}{ }
{336}{Once he proves you have rights, you can create a union...}{}{5}{}{345}{ }
{345}{For once old Babcock might be onto something.}{For once old Babcock might be onto something.}{}{}{}{ }
{346}{He said Wheeler is sure to kill you if he gets the chance.}{}{5}{}{355}{ }
{355}{Tell Babs not to worry, we'll slip out of here under the cover of night. I'll meet up with him later to plot the humiliation of Wheeler, among other things. Thank you for delivering this message to me.}{Tell Babs not to worry, we'll slip out of here under the cover of night. I'll meet up with him later to plot the humiliation of Wheeler, among other things. Thank you for delivering this message to me.}{}{}{}{fp }
{356}{You're welcome.}{}{5}{}{0}{gf2433 1, np1270 1 }
{365}{He is a weak willed do gooder who has chosen us as his latest cause. He is not a man who commands respect, and I tire of his worthless plans.}{He is a weak willed do gooder who has chosen us as his latest cause. He is not a man who commands respect, and I tire of his worthless plans.}{}{}{}{ }
{366}{As a council member, he has the respect of the courts.}{}{5}{}{375}{ }
{367}{His plans are a bit better than yours, at the moment.}{}{5}{}{295}{lf10 1 }
{375}{You can't be serious! The courts are all against us, and make new laws daily to keep us oppressed! I have had enough of your drivel. As a matter of fact, I had had enough of it last time I spoke with Babcock. Please leave me be.}{You can't be serious! The courts are all against us, and make new laws daily to keep us oppressed! I have had enough of your drivel. As a matter of fact, I had had enough of it last time I spoke with Babcock. Please leave me be.}{}{}{}{qu1146 6 }
{376}{Alright, I'm leaving.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{385}{Hah! If that could be made to happen, they would have handed us a very effective weapon indeed.}{Hah! If that could be made to happen, they would have handed us a very effective weapon indeed.}{}{}{}{ }
{386}{It would also put you legally beyond Wheeler's reach.}{}{5}{}{325}{ }
{387}{So obviously, it is time to put your fate in the hands of the court.}{}{5}{}{395}{ }
{395}{I said "if it could be made to happen". I do not believe it ever could. And until I thought there was a court worthy of my trust, I would never allow myself to be brought before one. I have had enough of our discussion. It seems obvious to me your intent is to bring me before the court, and I will have none of it. Goodbye.}{I said "if it could be made to happen". I do not believe it ever could. And until I thought there was a court worthy of my trust, I would never allow myself to be brought before one. I have had enough of our discussion. It seems obvious to me your intent is to bring me before the court, and I will have none of it. Goodbye.}{}{}{}{qu1146 6 }
{396}{Alright, I'm leaving.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{405}{Bravo, sir! At least you have the decency to fight me straight up, and not shoot me in the back. It will not keep me from taking your life, however.}{Bravo, madam! At least you have the decency to fight me straight up, and not shoot me in the back. It will not keep me from taking your life, however.}{}{}{}{ }
{410}{Yes, what is it now?}{Yes, what is it now?}{}{}{}{ }
{411}{We need to kill the totalitarians to free ourselves!}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{414}{Nothing, I must be going.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{415}{I don't need to listen to you try to get me or my friends killed in some suicidal rush to glory. Goodbye.}{I don't need to listen to you try to get me or my friends killed in some suicidal rush to glory. Goodbye.}{}{}{}{ }
{420}{Have you told Wheeler I've decided to surrender?}{Have you told Wheeler I've decided to surrender?}{}{}{}{ }
{421}{Not yet.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{425}{We're still waiting for the opportune moment to slip away from here undetected. Thanks for your help.}{We're still waiting for the opportune moment to slip away from here undetected. Thanks for your help.}{}{}{}{ }
{430}{I have already told you , I will not surrender!}{I have already told you , I will not surrender!}{}{}{}{ }
{431}{I have a better idea. Armed rebellion!}{}{5}{}{105}{ }
{434}{Okay, I will be leaving, then.}{}{5}{}{0}{ }
{435}{[This dark, brooding figure slowly turns to face you. His brutish features somehow accentuate his noble stature, rather than detract from it as one would expect.] What are you doing here?}{[This dark, brooding figure slowly turns to face you. His brutish features somehow accentuate his noble stature, rather than detract from it as one would expect.] What are you doing here?}{}{}{}{ }
{436}{I don't know?}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 445 ,co}
