{438}{I, uhm, am here by mistake.}{}{5}{}{0}{fl 445 ,co}
{445}{Lying dog! I know Wheeler sent you in here to kill me!}{Lying tramp! I know Wheeler sent you in here to kill me!}{}{}{}{ }
{450}{Death to the bourgeois pigs!}{Death to the bourgeois pigs!}{}{}{}{ }
{460}{I told you I want nothing to do with Babcock, or you, for that matter. Good bye.}{I told you I want nothing to do with Babcock, or you, for that matter. Good bye.}{}{}{}{ }
