{471}{I concur! Let the streets run red!}{}{5}{}{0}{gf2443 1, fl 450}
{472}{Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill! Kill!}{}{-4}{}{0}{gf2443 1, fl 450}
